Zero Extra Cost: Custom logo print karwane ke liye factory MOQ (Minimum Order Quantity) aur laser printing charges lagte hain, jo single-unit buying mein aapka profit kha jayenge.
2. Unboxing Ko "XPlay Branded" Kaise Dikhayein (Low-Cost Trick)
Controller par bina print karwaye bhi aap poore combo ko apna premium brand feel de sakte hain:
Outer Master Box: Ek bada matte-black outer box banwayein jis par XPlay ka logo aur tagline ho. Uske andar aapki XPlay SSD box + original Cosmic Byte/EvoFox controller box ek saath fit ho jayenge.
Custom Thumb Grips (Optional ₹40 Touch): Controller ke joysticks par lagane ke liye black-and-cyan/amber silicone thumb grips daal dein aur box mein ek XPlay sticker rakh dein—customer khud woh sticker laptop ya controller par lagayega.
Pre-Mapped in Master Image: Apne XPlay OS mein pehle se hi Cosmic Byte Ares aur Ant Esports ke button profiles save rakhein, taaki user dongle lagate hi seedha khel sake.
3. Apni Branding Kab Karein?
Jab aap mahine ke 50–100+ units bechne lagein, tab aap Nehru Place / Karol Bagh ya China (Alibaba) se unbranded white-label controllers (approx. ₹600–₹750 per piece) mangwa kar un par apna XPlay logo laser-print karwa sakte hain.
