Zero Marketing Guesswork: Jab product aasani se bikne lagega, toh aapko pata chal jayega ki customers ko kya sabse zyada pasand aa raha hai aur kahan support ki zaroorat pad rahi hai.
Price Badhane Ka Mauka: Pehle 20 units bikne ke baad aap easily offer close karke base price ₹9,999 (Drive Only) aur ₹11,499 (With Controller) kar sakte hain—tab aapka margin automatically ₹2,500–₹3,500 par aa jayega.
Bas Ek Chhota Sa Rule Yaad Rakhna
Sirf "First 20 Units" Tak Hi Yeh Offer Rakhna: Apni Instagram bio, post, aur WhatsApp par saaf likhna — "Founder's Launch Offer: Free Wireless Controller + GTA 5 Key for First 20 Orders Only." Isse urgency bhi banegi aur 20 orders ke baad price badhane par kisi ko bura bhi nahi lagega.
No COD Loss: ₹500 ke thin margin mein agar ek bhi COD order return (RTO) hua toh seedha loss hoga, isliye 100% Prepaid (ya kam se kam ₹1,500 non-refundable booking token) par hi ship karna.
