Neeche un games ki list hai jo aapke XPlay setup (controller + normal/mid-range laptop) par sabse best chalenge aur jinki keys aasani se milti hain:
1. Open-World & Story Games (GTA 5 Jaisa Feel)
Red Dead Redemption 2 (RDR2): Rockstar Games ka hi masterpiece hai ("Cowboy GTA"). Indian gamers mein iska craze GTA 5 ke barabar hai. Sale aur key sites par iski Rockstar/Steam key ₹1,050 – ₹1,300 ke aas-paas mil jati hai. (Bas dhyan rahe ki yeh GTA 5 se thoda heavy hai, isliye mid-range GPU wale laptops par best chalta hai).
Watch Dogs 2: Bilkul GTA 5 jaisa modern open-world action game hai jisme hacking aur car driving hai. Yeh purane ya normal laptops par bhi smoothly chal jata hai aur iski key ₹350 – ₹500 mein mil jati hai.
