Forza Horizon 4 / Forza Horizon 5: Open-world car racing ka king hai. Controller ke triggers par khelne mein bilkul PS5/Xbox wala feel aata hai.
Batman: Arkham Knight: Super-smooth action game jo normal laptops par bhi achha chalta hai aur iski key sirf ₹200 – ₹300 mein mil jati hai.
Aapke Business Ke Liye Smart Combo Trick
Agar aap GTA 5 ki ₹1,050 wali ek key dene ke bajay customer ko choice de dein—jaise "Get 1 Free GTA 5 Key OR Any 2 Hit Games (Tekken 7 + Watch Dogs 2 + Batman Arkham Knight)"—toh aapko un 2–3 games ki keys milakar sirf ₹600 – ₹800 mein padengi, aur customer ko lagega ki usse 3 bade games free mil gaye!
