PlayStation aur Xbox dono 3-color formula use karte hain: ek neutral base (White ya Black), ek signature brand color, aur ek dark contrast shade.
1. PlayStation Ka Color Palette (Total 3 Main Colors)
Pure Crisp White (#FFFFFF): PS5 console aur packaging ka main base color—jo clean, modern aur premium dikhta hai.
PlayStation Royal Blue (#003791 / #0070D1): Unka signature accent color, jo light strips, UI highlights, aur box borders par use hota hai.
Jet Black (#000000): Contrast ke liye (console ke center core aur text ke liye).
2. Xbox Ka Color Palette (Total 3 Main Colors)
Xbox Emerald Green (#107C10): Unka primary signature color, jo box packaging aur logo par sabse zyada dikhta hai.
Charcoal / Matte Black (#101010): Series X console aur dark UI background ke liye.
Clean White (#FFFFFF): Series S console, typography, aur contrast highlights ke liye.
3. XPlay Ke Liye Best "Light Theme" Palette (3 Colors)
Kyunki aapko Light Theme chahiye, toh PlayStation ke blue aur Xbox ke green se bilkul alag apni pehchan banane ke liye yeh 3-color light palette sabse clean aur premium lagega:
Base Color — Glacier White (#F8FAFC): Box packaging, website background, aur Batocera UI ke light background ke liye. Yeh pure white se thoda soft hota hai isliye TV/laptop screen par aankhon par zor nahi padta.
Primary Signature Color — Electric Indigo / Violet (#5B21B6 ya #6366F1): PlayStation ka Blue aur Xbox ka Green pehle se booked hain, isliye Electric Indigo/Purple aapka unique signature color banega. White background par yeh bahut sharp aur high-tech dikhta hai.
Dark Contrast & Text — Slate Charcoal (#0F172A): Game titles, icons, aur metal SSD enclosure ke liye.
Light Theme Par Product Kaise Dikhega
