alg alg provider pe alg alg price kasie dikhta hai domain ka how?
Har domain registrar ko registry (jaise .com ke liye Verisign) se ek fixed wholesale rate milta hai, lekin har provider apna profit margin, discount strategy, aur hidden add-ons alag-alag set karta hai—isliye aapko har website par alag price dikhta hai.
Neeche iske 5 asli kaaran diye gaye hain:
1. First-Year Loss Leader Discount vs. Renewal Trap
GoDaddy / BigRock / Hostinger: Yeh companies pehle saal ke liye ₹199 – ₹499 ka bhari discount deti hain taaki aap unke platform par aa jayein (aur saath mein hosting/email kharidein). Lekin 2nd year renewal par wahi domain ₹1,400 – ₹1,800 ka padta hai.
Cloudflare / Porkbun / Namecheap: Yeh companies wholesale ke bilkul paas (approx. ₹850 – ₹950) charge karti hain, aur 2nd year renewal bhi lagbhag utna hi rehta hai.
2. Free vs. Paid Add-Ons (WHOIS Privacy)
Jab aap domain kharidte hain, toh aapka naam, phone number, aur address public WHOIS directory mein dikh sakta hai.
Cloudflare / Namecheap: Is privacy ko hide karne ke liye ₹0 (lifetime free) lete hain.
GoDaddy / Kuch Indian Registrars: Iske liye alag se ₹300 – ₹600/year charge karte hain, jisse checkout par price badh jata hai.
3. Currency Conversion & 18% GST
.com domain ka base rate US Dollars (~$10.44) mein hota hai.
Indian registrars (jaise BigRock/GoDaddy India) Dollar-to-Rupee conversion par apna margin jodte hain aur upar se 18% Indian GST lagate hain, jabki international registrars seedha USD rate par card charge karte hain.
4. Multi-Year Lock-In Condition
Kai baar aapko banner par "₹299/yr" dikhta hai, lekin jab aap cart mein jaate hain toh woh price tabhi milta hai jab aap 2 ya 3 saal ke liye ek saath domain kharidein—1 saal select karte hi rate ₹1,100+ ho jata hai.
5. "Premium" Domain Tagging
Agar koi domain name short ya high-demand keywords wala hota hai, toh kuch registrars usko Premium Domain mark karke ₹20,000 se ₹2,00,000 tak list kar dete hain (halanki xplayconsole.com ek normal standard registration domain hai).
XPlay Ke Liye Best Buying Advice
Long-Term Sasta Option: Cloudflare Registrar ya Namecheap se lein—pehle saal aur har agle saal approx. ₹900–₹950 hi lagega aur WHOIS privacy free milegi.
UPI Se Lena Ho Toh: Hostinger India ya BigRock par pehle saal ka promo code lagakar ~₹500–₹700 mein le lein (bas checkout par extra "Domain Privacy" ya "Email Trial" untick karna na bhulein).
